        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG DOYLE are delighted to present this unique opportunity to acquire a ready to site with full planning permission for a 2 & 3 bed semi-detached homes.\n\nNestled on an private site within a stone's throw of Newbridge Town a highly convenient location only minutes from all amenities to include; schools, shops, supermarkets, churches, bars, restaurants, public transport facilities The property is also within close proximity of Newbridge train station, making commuting to and from The Capital hassle free.Liffey View is an established development is a sought after area in the middle of Newbridge. Accommodation will comprises of:\n3 Bed: Entrance hall, guest w.c., living room, kitchen/dining room, utility, 3 bedrooms (master en-suite) and bathroom.\n2 Bed: Entrance hall, shower room, open plan kitchen/living/dining, 2 bedrooms and bathroom. Full set of plans available on request. \n\nPlanning Reference Number 26/60371"
